ACME CORP
Store Information and Customer Policies
Sample document updated October 16, 2026

Acme Corp is a fictional general merchandise retailer. All products, prices, services, contact information, and policies in this document are invented for demonstration and testing. The example email addresses are placeholders and do not receive messages.

1. ABOUT ACME CORP

Acme Corp is a neighborhood general store built around a simple idea. Shopping for everyday essentials should be convenient, fairly priced, and easy to understand. We bring household supplies, practical electronics, office essentials, personal accessories, and seasonal merchandise together in one place. Our selection serves students furnishing their first apartments, families replacing everyday necessities, and small businesses keeping their workspaces organized.

We focus on useful products that solve ordinary problems. A storage container should fit the space described on its label. A charging cable should clearly identify the devices it supports. A desk lamp should provide enough information about brightness and power requirements for customers to make an informed decision. Our team aims to explain these details in straightforward language without pressuring customers into unnecessary upgrades.

Customers can shop in our demonstration storefront or place orders through our example online store. Product availability may differ between channels. This guide explains our standard practices, including ordering, payment, delivery, pickup, returns, rewards, and customer support.

2. STORE HOURS AND CUSTOMER SUPPORT

Our sample storefront operates Monday through Saturday from 9 AM to 8 PM and Sunday from 10 AM to 6 PM. All store and support hours use Eastern Time. Holiday closures and temporary schedule changes are announced on the storefront notice and online store banner.

Customer support is available Monday through Friday from 9 AM to 6 PM and Saturday from 10 AM to 4 PM. Support is closed on Sundays and announced holidays. Customers may email support@acmecorp.example at any time. Our target is to provide an initial response within one business day, although complex investigations may take longer.

For order questions, include the order number, the email address used at checkout, and a short description of the issue. Include photographs when reporting visible damage or an incorrect item. Do not send full payment card numbers, passwords, or account security codes. Store employees can assist with product selection and routine returns, while the support team handles delivery investigations and account concerns.

In this guide, business days mean Monday through Friday, excluding announced holidays. Calendar days include weekends and holidays. Shipping estimates use business days. Return windows use calendar days.

3. PRODUCTS AND DEPARTMENTS

Home and kitchen products include food storage containers, utensils, towels, mugs, cleaning tools, small shelving units, and basic cookware. Listings identify dimensions, materials, care instructions, and included components whenever available. Customers should check measurements before buying organizers or furniture intended for a particular cabinet, closet, or room.

Electronics and accessories include charging cables, power adapters, headphones, keyboards, computer mice, desk lamps, and portable speakers. Compatibility depends on the individual product. A matching connector alone does not guarantee that an accessory supports every device feature. Customers should review power requirements and compatibility notes before purchase.

Office and school supplies include notebooks, printer paper, pens, folders, desk organizers, and shipping materials. Personal and travel accessories include reusable bottles, tote bags, umbrellas, toiletry organizers, and small luggage accessories. Seasonal departments may feature gardening supplies, holiday decorations, picnic items, and dorm essentials.

Our illustrative selection includes a 24-ounce insulated bottle for $19.99, a six-piece drawer organizer set for $16.99, an adjustable LED desk lamp for $29.99, and a three-pack of lined notebooks for $8.99. These are sample prices before tax. Product listings display the current price and stock status for each item.

4. PRODUCT INFORMATION AND AVAILABILITY

Photographs help illustrate a product, but screen settings can affect how colors appear. Decorative objects shown alongside an item are not included unless the listing explicitly says otherwise. Package contents are determined by the written listing and the manufacturer's packaging description.

Inventory is updated regularly, but an item can become unavailable between checkout and fulfillment. If we cannot fulfill a purchased item, we contact the customer and refund the unavailable item and its applicable tax. We never substitute a different size, color, or model without approval. Any remaining items continue through fulfillment unless the customer requests cancellation before they ship.

We do not accept backorders unless a listing explicitly identifies the item as available for backorder and provides an estimated dispatch date. Preorder dates are estimates rather than delivery guarantees. If a preorder is delayed, customers may cancel the unshipped item for a full refund.

5. PRICING, DISCOUNTS, AND PAYMENT

All prices are listed in US dollars. Applicable taxes and shipping charges appear before an order is submitted. Accepted online payments include Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover, Acme Corp gift cards, and supported digital wallets shown at checkout. The sample storefront also accepts cash. Personal checks, cryptocurrency, and installment billing are not offered.

Payment authorization may occur when an order is placed. Payment is captured when the order ships or becomes ready for pickup. A temporary authorization on a canceled order may remain visible until the customer's payment provider releases it.

Only one promotional code may be applied per order unless the promotion states otherwise. Discounts cannot reduce an item's price below zero and do not apply to taxes, shipping charges, or gift card purchases. A gift card used as payment may be combined with a promotional code because it is a payment method rather than a discount.

If our advertised price for the same item drops within seven calendar days after purchase, customers may request one price adjustment with proof of purchase. Clearance markdowns, limited-quantity flash sales, and coupon-only offers are excluded. We do not match competitor prices. If a listing contains a clear pricing error, we explain the error and offer cancellation rather than charging a higher price without approval.

6. PLACING, CHANGING, AND CANCELING ORDERS

Customers may check out as guests or create an account. An account provides access to saved addresses, order history, and reward balances. After checkout, an order confirmation summarizes the items, delivery address, selected service, and estimated total. Customers should review that confirmation promptly.

Cancellation requests can be submitted while an order remains unshipped. Our team attempts to stop fulfillment, but a request is not guaranteed once packing begins. A cancellation is complete only after the customer receives confirmation. If the package has already shipped, the customer may use the applicable return process after delivery.

Address corrections follow the same timing limits. We cannot guarantee that a carrier can redirect a dispatched package. To change a product, size, or quantity, contact support. Depending on the fulfillment stage, we may cancel the affected item and ask the customer to place a replacement order.

Suspected duplicate orders are reviewed individually. Customers should not assume that a repeated order will be canceled automatically. We may request additional verification when transaction details appear inconsistent, but support will never request a customer's password or full card number.

7. SHIPPING AND DELIVERY

Acme Corp ships to residential and business street addresses within the contiguous United States. This sample service does not support Alaska, Hawaii, US territories, international destinations, PO boxes, or military postal addresses.

Standard shipping costs $5.99 for merchandise totals below $50 and is free for merchandise totals of $50 or more. Eligibility is calculated after discounts and before tax. Gift card purchases do not count toward the threshold. Expedited shipping costs $14.99 for eligible orders. Oversized items may carry a clearly disclosed surcharge and may not qualify for expedited service.

Most in-stock orders require one to two business days for processing. Standard transit generally takes three to five business days after dispatch. Expedited transit generally takes one to two business days after dispatch and does not shorten processing time. Weather, carrier disruptions, and holiday demand can affect these estimates.

Tracking information is sent when a shipping label is created. Carrier tracking may not show movement immediately. Orders may arrive in separate packages at no additional shipping charge. If Acme Corp cancels an unavailable item and the remaining total falls below $50, the original free standard shipping benefit is preserved.

8. PICKUP AND DELIVERY PROBLEMS

Free store pickup is available only for items marked eligible during checkout. Customers should wait for the ready-for-pickup message before visiting. Most pickup orders are prepared within one business day. Bring the order number and photo identification. Another person may collect an order if the purchaser authorizes that person's name through support before pickup.

Pickup orders are held for five calendar days after the ready message. Customers may request one extension of up to three additional calendar days. Uncollected orders are canceled and refunded after the hold period ends.

If tracking says delivered but a package is missing, check nearby entrances, building reception, and household members, then contact support promptly. Reports within seven calendar days help us investigate with the carrier. Support reviews tracking details and delivery evidence before determining whether a replacement or refund is appropriate. That reporting target does not automatically eliminate a valid claim made later.

For damaged, incorrect, or incomplete deliveries, retain the packaging and send photographs if practical. Customers should stop using any item that appears unsafe. Confirmed fulfillment errors and damage present on arrival qualify for a replacement or refund without return shipping charges.

9. RETURNS AND EXCHANGES

Most merchandise may be returned within 30 calendar days after delivery or in-store purchase. Electronics have a 14-calendar-day return window. For pickup orders, the window begins when the customer collects the order. Eligible products must include their original accessories and be in unused or gently inspected condition. Ordinary inspection means the limited handling needed to assess the item, not extended everyday use.

Proof of purchase may be a receipt, order confirmation, or a transaction that our team can locate in the customer's account. Without verifiable proof, we cannot process a routine change-of-mind return. Original packaging is preferred, but missing packaging alone does not disqualify an otherwise eligible return unless the listing specifically identifies protective packaging as necessary for safe return shipment.

Opened personal hygiene products, personalized goods, downloadable products, and items clearly marked final sale are excluded from change-of-mind returns. Gift cards are not returnable through the standard return program. These exclusions do not prevent customers from reporting defective, damaged, or incorrectly supplied merchandise. Any applicable customer rights remain unaffected.

To start a mailed return, contact support with the order number and items being returned. Eligible change-of-mind returns using our prepaid label have a $5.99 deduction per return package. Customers may instead return eligible merchandise in store without that label charge. Returns caused by our error or a confirmed defect receive a free return label when shipping is required.

We do not charge a separate restocking fee. Original shipping charges are not refunded for change-of-mind returns. When the entire order is returned because of our error, we also refund its original shipping charge. Promotional discounts are allocated across eligible items, so refunds reflect the amount actually paid. We do not retroactively charge standard shipping when a partial return reduces the retained merchandise total below $50.

Exchanges depend on available stock. A different item or price is handled as a return and a new purchase. Gift recipients with a gift receipt may receive store credit for the eligible return amount.

10. REFUNDS AND PRODUCT PROBLEMS

Returned merchandise is normally inspected within five business days after arrival. Approved refunds go to the original payment method. Payment providers may take an additional five to ten business days to display the credit. Purchases split between a gift card and another payment method are refunded proportionally to those methods.

For defective products reported within 90 calendar days after delivery or purchase, Acme Corp offers an assessment and, if the defect is confirmed, a replacement or refund. This store promise covers faults arising during normal intended use. It does not cover accidental damage, misuse, unauthorized modification, or ordinary wear. A replacement is offered only with customer agreement.

Some products also include a manufacturer's warranty with separate coverage and procedures. Support can help customers identify the appropriate contact. Manufacturer coverage does not replace our responsibility for shipping the correct item or resolving an eligible store-policy claim. If a product is recalled, customers should stop using it and follow the specific recall instructions provided.

11. GIFT CARDS AND ACME REWARDS

Acme Corp digital gift cards are available in amounts from $10 to $250. They have no expiration date or maintenance fees under this sample program. They may be used online or in store and cannot be used to buy additional gift cards. Customers should protect gift card codes as they would cash. Lost codes can be investigated when proof of purchase is available, although recovery is not guaranteed if the balance has already been used.

Acme Rewards is a free optional program. Members earn one point for each whole dollar of eligible merchandise spending after discounts and before tax and shipping. Gift card purchases do not earn points, but eligible merchandise purchased with a gift card does. Points become available 14 calendar days after delivery or pickup.

Every 100 points may be redeemed for a $5 merchandise discount on a future purchase. Up to 300 points may be redeemed per order. Points have no cash value and expire after 12 consecutive months without an eligible purchase. Returns reverse associated earned points. If redeemed points applied to a returned item, that allocated portion is restored, while the cash refund reflects only the amount actually paid.

12. PRIVACY AND ACCOUNT SECURITY

Acme Corp collects information needed to process purchases and support customers, such as names, contact details, shipping addresses, and order records. Payment processing is handled by a payment provider. Customer support does not need access to full card numbers. Delivery providers receive the information needed to transport and deliver packages.

Essential website functions use cookies for shopping carts and account sessions. Optional analytics and marketing preferences are managed through the example store's privacy controls. Promotional email enrollment is optional, and customers may unsubscribe without losing access to order confirmations or delivery notices.

Under this sample policy, Acme Corp does not sell customer personal information. Requests to access, correct, or delete account information may be sent to privacy@acmecorp.example. Some transaction records may need to be retained for accounting, security, or dispute handling. We explain relevant limitations when responding to a request. Customers should use unique passwords and report suspected unauthorized account activity promptly.

13. ACCESSIBILITY, BUSINESS ORDERS, AND CUSTOMER CONDUCT

Customers who need help reading product information, placing an order, or arranging a return can contact support for assistance. Our service goal is to make shopping practical for customers with different communication and accessibility needs. If a website feature prevents a purchase, staff can help identify an alternative ordering method.

Businesses, schools, and community organizations purchasing 25 or more units of the same item may request a bulk quote. Quotes remain valid for 14 calendar days unless stated otherwise. A quote does not reserve inventory until the order is accepted. Standard return rules apply unless a clearly stated custom-order condition is agreed before purchase.

Customers and staff are expected to communicate respectfully. Threats, harassment, deliberate damage, and fraudulent activity may result in service restrictions. Complaints are reviewed based on the facts, and disagreement with a policy does not itself justify refusing assistance. Customers who believe a decision is incorrect may request supervisor review through support.

14. POLICY UPDATES AND COMMON QUESTIONS

The policy version provided at purchase governs that transaction unless a later change benefits the customer and Acme Corp agrees to apply it. Product-specific exceptions must be disclosed before checkout. If a listing conflicts with this guide, support will review the purchase record and the terms shown when the order was placed.

Can I return an item bought on sale? Yes, if it meets the normal return requirements and was not clearly marked final sale. Can I cancel after shipping? A shipped order cannot be canceled, but eligible products may be returned. Does expedited delivery mean next-day arrival? No, processing time comes before the estimated expedited transit period.

Can I use a coupon and a gift card together? Yes, subject to the coupon's restrictions. What if only part of my order arrives? Check the shipping messages for separate packages, then contact support if an item remains unexplained. Where do I ask for help? Use support@acmecorp.example for this fictional store's general support channel.

END OF ACME CORP SAMPLE STORE GUIDE
